    "negative": "NOT TRUE includes FALSE and UNKNOWN; NULL are physical source facts, not implicit SQL matches",
    "source_provenance": "Every finite transformed terminal row references its complete immutable VALUES source snapshot by positional source-row ids, including duplicate and NULL rows."
